{"corpus":"ccc","number":2795,"text_html":"<span>Le symbole des cieux nous renvoie au mystère de l’Alliance que nous vivons lorsque nous prions notre Père. Il est aux cieux, c’est sa Demeure, la Maison du Père est donc notre « patrie<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§1024</sup> ». C’est de la terre de l’Alliance que le péché nous a exilés <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup> et c’est vers le Père, vers le ciel que la conversion du cœur nous fait revenir <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"2\">2</sup>. Or c’est dans le Christ que le ciel et la terre sont réconciliés <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"7\">3</sup>, car le Fils « est descendu du ciel », seul, et il nous y fait remonter avec lui, par sa Croix, sa Résurrection et son Ascension (voir <a class=\"bibRef\">Jn 12:32</a> ; <a class=\"bibRef level1 ChapVerset\">14:2-3</a> ; <a class=\"bibRef level2 ChapVerset\">16:28</a> ; <a class=\"bibRef level3 ChapVerset\">20:17</a> ; <a class=\"bibRef\">Ep 4:9-10</a> ; <a class=\"bibRef\">He 1:3</a> ; <a class=\"bibRef level1 ChapVerset\">2:13</a>).</span>","cross_refs":["1024"],"bible_refs":[{"text":"Gn 3"},{"text":"Jr 3:19"},{"text":"Jr 4:1a"},{"text":"Lc 15:18"},{"text":"Lc 15:21"},{"text":"Is 45:8"},{"text":"Ps 85:12"},{"text":"Jn 12:32"},{"text":"Jn 14:2-3"},{"text":"Jn 16:28"},{"text":"Jn 20:17"},{"text":"Ep 4:9-10"},{"text":"He 1:3"},{"text":"He 2:13"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Gn 3","idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Jr 3:19–4:1a","idx":2,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"Lc 15:18","idx":3,"marker_idx":2,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"15:21","idx":4,"marker_idx":2,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Is 45:8","idx":5,"marker_idx":2,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"Ps 85:12","idx":6,"marker_idx":2,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Jn 12:32","idx":7,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"14:2-3","idx":8,"marker_idx":7,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"16:28","idx":9,"marker_idx":7,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"20:17","idx":10,"marker_idx":7,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"Ep 4:9-10","idx":11,"marker_idx":7,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"He 1:3","idx":12,"marker_idx":7,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"2:13","idx":13,"marker_idx":7,"display_idx":3}]}